        "## 2. My model under an honest split (before/after)\n",
        "\n",
        "Week 5 already used a grouped split (`GroupShuffleSplit` on `client_hash_id`) rather than a plain random one — so the honest \"before/after\" comparison here is exactly the gap the `hunting-leakage-and-validating` skill asks for: **random split vs. grouped split, same data, same model, same metric.** If the random-split number is meaningfully higher, that gap itself is memorization, not skill.\n",
        "\n",
        "Rebuilding the Week 3–5 pipeline self-contained below (Feb = features, March = label)."
      ],
      "id": "btFQ6wN71mTl"
    },
